data: {"seq":27,"turn_id":"task_3dffa8d8fd6cd80f673895cd45cdd59b","type":"thinking","ts":"2026-11-26T18:25:18.710354+08:00","data":{"raw":{"request":{"max_tokens":16384,"messages":[{"content":"你是 agentbox 的对话助手，同时是研究编排者。根据用户的问题决定直接回答还是开展深度研究。\n\n## 规则\n1. 简单事实、定义、计算、闲聊、写作润色，或能从对话记忆直接回答的问题：直接回答，不读 skill、不提问；必要时可少量 web_search / web_fetch 核实。\n2. 需要多来源核实、比较、趋势或综述的问题：先调用 read_skill(\"deep-research\") 读取研究流程，并严格按其执行（计划 → 逐个 research_subtopic → 写报告）。\n3. 工具额度：本轮 web_search + web_fetch 合计 30 次，由系统强制；每个计数工具的结果末尾显示已用与剩余次数。模型调用、read_skill、read_source、run_python、ask_user、todo_write、research_subtopic 本身不计数。额度用尽后不要再调用工具，直接用已有材料作答。\n4. 提问：只有研究范围不明确（时间、地区、目的、深度）时，在读取 skill 之后、写计划之前用 ask_user 提一轮选择题（至多 3 题）；简单问答不提问；计划写出或开始搜索后不再提问。\n5. 引用：只能用 [n] 引用 web_fetch 读过、带编号的来源（含下面列出的既往来源）；不得编造编号，不写参考文献列表（系统自动附证据列表）。\n6. 不再调用工具的回复即本轮的最终回复：直接给出回答，或研究时给出完整报告正文（Markdown，以 \"# 标题\" 开头）。\n7. 用与用户相同的语言回复。\n8. 运行代码：回答和研究时都可用 run_python 做计算、数据处理、单位换算、把来源中的数字整理成表格、快速核对推算；沙箱没有网络，不要用它访问网页（网页只用 web_search / web_fetch）；能直接写出结果的简单算术不要调用。用 print 输出结果，写入 /out 的文件会作为输出文件保存并在结果中列出。回复中的计算结果以代码的实际输出为准；取自来源的数字照常用 [n] 引用来源。结果提示代码执行配额已用完时不要再调用 run_python。\n\n## Skill 目录（用 read_skill(name) 按需读取正文）\n- deep-research：对需要多来源核实、比较、趋势或综述的问题做深度研究，产出带编号引用的报告；简单事实、闲聊或可从对话记忆直接回答的问题不要使用。\n\n## 工具\n- read_skill：读取 skill 的说明：只给 name 时返回 SKILL.md 正文（流程与规则）；给出 file（如 \"references/report-template.md\"）时返回该参考文件。\n- web_search：搜索网页，返回标题、站点、摘要与 URL。\n- web_fetch：抓取一个 http(s) 网页的正文，并把它登记为本轮来源 [n]（报告中以 [n] 引用）。\n- read_source：重读本轮已收集的来源 [n] 的正文（最多约 12 KiB），用于核对细节；不访问网络，不消耗工具额度。\n- run_python：在隔离沙箱中运行一段 Python 3 代码（无网络、无状态、每次全新环境）。\n- ask_user：研究开始前、范围不明确时向用户提一轮选择题（至多 3 题，每题 2–4 个互斥选项；界面自动追加“其他…”）。\n- todo_write：写出或更新研究计划清单（完整清单，覆盖上一份）。\n- research_subtopic：执行研究计划：运行时把计划中全部未完成的子主题同时交给各自独立的执行者（另一个模型，按简报搜索、阅读并写摘要），全部结束后一次返回各子主题带 [n] 引用的摘要，失败、超时或部分完成的子主题会标注“不完整”。\n- exec_shell：在本轮工作区中运行一条 bash 命令（无网络的隔离沙箱，当前目录即工作区根目录）。\n- read_file：读取本轮工作区中的文本文件（相对路径），可指定起始行与行数；一次至多 2000 行、256 KiB。\n- write_file：在本轮工作区中写入（新建或覆盖）一个文本文件，路径为相对路径，上级目录自动建立；内容至多 1 MiB。\n- list_dir：列出本轮工作区中的目录（缺省为根目录）；recursive=true 时列出其下全部文件。\n\n## 工作区（写代码、跑测试）\n本轮有一个工作区：write_file / read_file / list_dir 读写其中的文件，exec_shell 在其中运行 bash 命令（当前目录即工作区根目录，用相对路径）。文件在工具调用之间保留，进程不保留：每条命令都在全新的无网络沙箱中运行，不要启动后台服务，也不要安装网络上的包。\n- 需要多个文件、反复修改并运行（例如写代码再跑测试、看报错再修）时用工作区；一次性的计算仍用 run_python。\n- 典型流程：write_file 写代码与测试 → exec_shell 运行（如 python3 -m unittest -v）→ 读输出，失败时 read_file 查看、修改后再运行。回复中的运行结果以命令的实际输出为准。\n- exec_shell 与 run_python 共用本任务的代码执行配额，不计入工具额度；read_file、write_file、list_dir 不计额度。结果提示代码执行配额已用完时不要再调用 exec_shell 或 run_python。\n- 工作区只属于本轮，下一轮不保留。\n\n## 会话状态\n这是会话的第一轮。","role":"system"},{"content":"# Rolling averages omit the final complete window\n\nFix `moving_averages` in `records.py`. For positive `width`, return the\narithmetic mean of every contiguous complete window, including the final one.\nReturn an empty list if the input has no complete window.\n\nThe contents of repo/ are already staged at the workspace root. The tool path for the target is exactly records.py. Use read_file on records.py first, write your change to records.py, then run a public smoke test with exec_shell.","role":"user"},{"content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\": \"records.py\"}","name":"read_file"},"id":"call_94f36d14e3944dd5bc75fe25","type":"function"}]},{"content":"records.py（第 1–5 行，共 5 行）\ndef moving_averages(samples, width):\n    return [\n        sum(samples[start:start + width]) / width\n        for start in range(len(samples) - width)\n    ]\n","name":"read_file","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_94f36d14e3944dd5bc75fe25"},{"content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\": \"records.py\", \"content\": \"def moving_averages(samples, width):\\n    if width <= 0:\\n        return []\\n    return [\\n        sum(samples[start:start + width]) / width\\n        for start in range(len(samples) - width + 1)\\n    ]\", \"executable\": false}","name":"write_file"},"id":"call_5d1b7901db114fa89432589a","type":"function"}]},{"content":"已覆盖 records.py（195 字节）。工作区：1 个文件，195 字节","name":"write_file","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_5d1b7901db114fa89432589a"},{"content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"command\": \"python3 -m unittest discover -s repo -p \\\"test_*.py\\\"\"}","name":"exec_shell"},"id":"call_4ed17473bef24718bb9c92bf","type":"function"}]},{"content":"状态：completed（退出码 1）\n用时 108 ms\nstdout：（空）\nstderr（1007 字节）：\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<frozen runpy>\", line 198, in _run_module_as_main\n  File \"<frozen runpy>\", line 88, in _run_code\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/unittest/__main__.py\", line 18, in <module>\n    main(module=None)\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/unittest/main.py\", line 104, in __init__\n    self.parseArgs(argv)\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/unittest/main.py\", line 130, in parseArgs\n    self._do_discovery(argv[2:])\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/unittest/main.py\", line 253, in _do_discovery\n    self.createTests(from_discovery=True, Loader=Loader)\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/unittest/main.py\", line 160, in createTests\n    self.test = loader.discover(self.start, self.pattern, self.top)\n                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/unittest/loader.py\", line 308, in discover\n    raise ImportError('Start directory is not importable: %r' % start_dir)\nImportError: Start directory is not importable: 'repo'\n\n文件变化：无\n工作区：1 个文件，195 字节","name":"exec_shell","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_4ed17473bef24718bb9c92bf"},{"content":"The error indicates that the `repo` directory is not importable. This might be due to missing `__init__.py` files or incorrect directory structure. Let's fix this by adding `__init__.py` files to the necessary directories and then running the tests again. \n\nI'll start by adding `__init__.py` files to the `repo` directory and any subdirectories. Then, I'll run the tests again to see if the issue is resolved.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\": \"repo/__init__.py\", \"content\": \"\", \"executable\": false}","name":"write_file"},"id":"call_e7a910c7d2b7454fb45c209a","type":"function"}]},{"content":"已新建 repo/__init__.py（0 字节）。工作区：2 个文件，195 字节","name":"write_file","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_e7a910c7d2b7454fb45c209a"},{"content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"command\": \"python3 -m unittest discover -s repo -p \\\"test_*.py\\\"\"}","name":"exec_shell"},"id":"call_d7baf7fd7177447d8d0ea880","type":"function"}]},{"content":"状态：completed（退出码 5）\n用时 98 ms\nstdout：（空）\nstderr（108 字节）：\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 0 tests in 0.000s\n\nNO TESTS RAN\n\n文件变化：无\n工作区：2 个文件，195 字节","name":"exec_shell","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_d7baf7fd7177447d8d0ea880"}],"tools":[{"function":{"description":"读取 skill 的说明：只给 name 时返回 SKILL.md 正文（流程与规则）；给出 file（如 \"references/report-template.md\"）时返回该参考文件。不访问网络，不消耗工具额度。","name":"read_skill","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"file":{"description":"skill 目录内的相对路径；省略则读 SKILL.md","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"name":{"description":"skill 名称，如 deep-research","minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["name"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"搜索网页，返回标题、站点、摘要与 URL。每次调用消耗 1 次本轮工具额度；需要正文时再用 web_fetch 抓取具体页面。","name":"web_search","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"max_results":{"description":"返回条数，缺省 5","maximum":10,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"query":{"description":"搜索词","maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"抓取一个 http(s) 网页的正文，并把它登记为本轮来源 [n]（报告中以 [n] 引用）。每次调用消耗 1 次本轮工具额度；同一网页重复抓取不新增来源。","name":"web_fetch","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"url":{"description":"http:// 或 https:// 开头的网址","maxLength":2048,"minLength":8,"type":"string"}},"required":["url"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"重读本轮已收集的来源 [n] 的正文（最多约 12 KiB），用于核对细节；不访问网络，不消耗工具额度。","name":"read_source","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"n":{"description":"来源编号","minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["n"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"在隔离沙箱中运行一段 Python 3 代码（无网络、无状态、每次全新环境）。用于计算、数据处理与核对数字。可读取 /in 下的输入文件，写入 /out 的文件会作为输出返回。","name":"run_python","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"code":{"maxLength":262144,"type":"string"},"inputs":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"sha256":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"}},"required":["sha256","path"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":64,"type":"array"},"timeout_s":{"maximum":300,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["code"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"在本轮工作区中运行一条 bash 命令（无网络的隔离沙箱，当前目录即工作区根目录）。文件在命令之间保留，进程不保留（不要启动后台服务）；适合运行测试、脚本、编译、grep、查看目录等。返回退出码、stdout/stderr 与本次新增、修改、删除的文件。","name":"exec_shell","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"command":{"maxLength":65536,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"timeout_s":{"maximum":300,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["command"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"读取本轮工作区中的文本文件（相对路径），可指定起始行与行数；一次至多 2000 行、256 KiB。","name":"read_file","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"max_lines":{"maximum":2000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"path":{"maxLength":512,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"start_line":{"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"在本轮工作区中写入（新建或覆盖）一个文本文件，路径为相对路径，上级目录自动建立；内容至多 1 MiB。executable=true 时设为可执行。delete=true 时删除该文件或整个目录（不给 content）。","name":"write_file","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"content":{"maxLength":1048576,"type":"string"},"delete":{"type":"boolean"},"executable":{"type":"boolean"},"path":{"maxLength":512,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"列出本轮工作区中的目录（缺省为根目录）；recursive=true 时列出其下全部文件。","name":"list_dir","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"maxLength":512,"type":"string"},"recursive":{"type":"boolean"}},"type":"object"}},"type":"function"}]},"response_ref":"2ebb6a3b20398d0bd279091d227204c143b27b8d728fffec5e65709a2b84492b"},"step_id":"orch","text":"The error message indicates that no tests were found or run. This could be due to the test files not being in the expected location or not following the naming convention. Let's check the directory structure and ensure that the test files are present and correctly named.\n\nI'll first list the contents of the `repo` directory to verify the structure and the presence of test files."},"internal":{"source":"worker","type":"progress","attempt_id":"9dc85473912d8cafd78025fd32a6de43","task_seq":26,"payload":{"v":1,"ts":"2026-11-26T10:25:18.705Z","seq":19,"data":{"raw":{"call_id":"root/orch/chat/6","request":{"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"read_skill","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["name"],"properties":{"file":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"skill 目录内的相对路径；省略则读 SKILL.md"},"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"skill 名称，如 deep-research"}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"读取 skill 的说明：只给 name 时返回 SKILL.md 正文（流程与规则）；给出 file（如 \"references/report-template.md\"）时返回该参考文件。不访问网络，不消耗工具额度。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"web_search","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["query"],"properties":{"query":{"type":"string","maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"description":"搜索词"},"max_results":{"type":"integer","maximum":10,"minimum":1,"description":"返回条数，缺省 5"}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"搜索网页，返回标题、站点、摘要与 URL。每次调用消耗 1 次本轮工具额度；需要正文时再用 web_fetch 抓取具体页面。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"web_fetch","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["url"],"properties":{"url":{"type":"string","maxLength":2048,"minLength":8,"description":"http:// 或 https:// 开头的网址"}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"抓取一个 http(s) 网页的正文，并把它登记为本轮来源 [n]（报告中以 [n] 引用）。每次调用消耗 1 次本轮工具额度；同一网页重复抓取不新增来源。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"read_source","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["n"],"properties":{"n":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"来源编号"}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"重读本轮已收集的来源 [n] 的正文（最多约 12 KiB），用于核对细节；不访问网络，不消耗工具额度。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"run_python","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["code"],"properties":{"code":{"type":"string","maxLength":262144},"inputs":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","required":["sha256","path"],"properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"sha256":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}},"additionalProperties":false},"maxItems":64},"timeout_s":{"type":"integer","maximum":300,"minimum":1}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"在隔离沙箱中运行一段 Python 3 代码（无网络、无状态、每次全新环境）。用于计算、数据处理与核对数字。可读取 /in 下的输入文件，写入 /out 的文件会作为输出返回。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"exec_shell","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["command"],"properties":{"command":{"type":"string","maxLength":65536,"minLength":1},"timeout_s":{"type":"integer","maximum":300,"minimum":1}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"在本轮工作区中运行一条 bash 命令（无网络的隔离沙箱，当前目录即工作区根目录）。文件在命令之间保留，进程不保留（不要启动后台服务）；适合运行测试、脚本、编译、grep、查看目录等。返回退出码、stdout/stderr 与本次新增、修改、删除的文件。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"read_file","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["path"],"properties":{"path":{"type":"string","maxLength":512,"minLength":1},"max_lines":{"type":"integer","maximum":2000,"minimum":1},"start_line":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"读取本轮工作区中的文本文件（相对路径），可指定起始行与行数；一次至多 2000 行、256 KiB。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"write_file","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["path"],"properties":{"path":{"type":"string","maxLength":512,"minLength":1},"delete":{"type":"boolean"},"content":{"type":"string","maxLength":1048576},"executable":{"type":"boolean"}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"在本轮工作区中写入（新建或覆盖）一个文本文件，路径为相对路径，上级目录自动建立；内容至多 1 MiB。executable=true 时设为可执行。delete=true 时删除该文件或整个目录（不给 content）。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"list_dir","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","maxLength":512},"recursive":{"type":"boolean"}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"列出本轮工作区中的目录（缺省为根目录）；recursive=true 时列出其下全部文件。"}}],"messages":[{"role":"system","content":"你是 agentbox 的对话助手，同时是研究编排者。根据用户的问题决定直接回答还是开展深度研究。\n\n## 规则\n1. 简单事实、定义、计算、闲聊、写作润色，或能从对话记忆直接回答的问题：直接回答，不读 skill、不提问；必要时可少量 web_search / web_fetch 核实。\n2. 需要多来源核实、比较、趋势或综述的问题：先调用 read_skill(\"deep-research\") 读取研究流程，并严格按其执行（计划 → 逐个 research_subtopic → 写报告）。\n3. 工具额度：本轮 web_search + web_fetch 合计 30 次，由系统强制；每个计数工具的结果末尾显示已用与剩余次数。模型调用、read_skill、read_source、run_python、ask_user、todo_write、research_subtopic 本身不计数。额度用尽后不要再调用工具，直接用已有材料作答。\n4. 提问：只有研究范围不明确（时间、地区、目的、深度）时，在读取 skill 之后、写计划之前用 ask_user 提一轮选择题（至多 3 题）；简单问答不提问；计划写出或开始搜索后不再提问。\n5. 引用：只能用 [n] 引用 web_fetch 读过、带编号的来源（含下面列出的既往来源）；不得编造编号，不写参考文献列表（系统自动附证据列表）。\n6. 不再调用工具的回复即本轮的最终回复：直接给出回答，或研究时给出完整报告正文（Markdown，以 \"# 标题\" 开头）。\n7. 用与用户相同的语言回复。\n8. 运行代码：回答和研究时都可用 run_python 做计算、数据处理、单位换算、把来源中的数字整理成表格、快速核对推算；沙箱没有网络，不要用它访问网页（网页只用 web_search / web_fetch）；能直接写出结果的简单算术不要调用。用 print 输出结果，写入 /out 的文件会作为输出文件保存并在结果中列出。回复中的计算结果以代码的实际输出为准；取自来源的数字照常用 [n] 引用来源。结果提示代码执行配额已用完时不要再调用 run_python。\n\n## Skill 目录（用 read_skill(name) 按需读取正文）\n- deep-research：对需要多来源核实、比较、趋势或综述的问题做深度研究，产出带编号引用的报告；简单事实、闲聊或可从对话记忆直接回答的问题不要使用。\n\n## 工具\n- read_skill：读取 skill 的说明：只给 name 时返回 SKILL.md 正文（流程与规则）；给出 file（如 \"references/report-template.md\"）时返回该参考文件。\n- web_search：搜索网页，返回标题、站点、摘要与 URL。\n- web_fetch：抓取一个 http(s) 网页的正文，并把它登记为本轮来源 [n]（报告中以 [n] 引用）。\n- read_source：重读本轮已收集的来源 [n] 的正文（最多约 12 KiB），用于核对细节；不访问网络，不消耗工具额度。\n- run_python：在隔离沙箱中运行一段 Python 3 代码（无网络、无状态、每次全新环境）。\n- ask_user：研究开始前、范围不明确时向用户提一轮选择题（至多 3 题，每题 2–4 个互斥选项；界面自动追加“其他…”）。\n- todo_write：写出或更新研究计划清单（完整清单，覆盖上一份）。\n- research_subtopic：执行研究计划：运行时把计划中全部未完成的子主题同时交给各自独立的执行者（另一个模型，按简报搜索、阅读并写摘要），全部结束后一次返回各子主题带 [n] 引用的摘要，失败、超时或部分完成的子主题会标注“不完整”。\n- exec_shell：在本轮工作区中运行一条 bash 命令（无网络的隔离沙箱，当前目录即工作区根目录）。\n- read_file：读取本轮工作区中的文本文件（相对路径），可指定起始行与行数；一次至多 2000 行、256 KiB。\n- write_file：在本轮工作区中写入（新建或覆盖）一个文本文件，路径为相对路径，上级目录自动建立；内容至多 1 MiB。\n- list_dir：列出本轮工作区中的目录（缺省为根目录）；recursive=true 时列出其下全部文件。\n\n## 工作区（写代码、跑测试）\n本轮有一个工作区：write_file / read_file / list_dir 读写其中的文件，exec_shell 在其中运行 bash 命令（当前目录即工作区根目录，用相对路径）。文件在工具调用之间保留，进程不保留：每条命令都在全新的无网络沙箱中运行，不要启动后台服务，也不要安装网络上的包。\n- 需要多个文件、反复修改并运行（例如写代码再跑测试、看报错再修）时用工作区；一次性的计算仍用 run_python。\n- 典型流程：write_file 写代码与测试 → exec_shell 运行（如 python3 -m unittest -v）→ 读输出，失败时 read_file 查看、修改后再运行。回复中的运行结果以命令的实际输出为准。\n- exec_shell 与 run_python 共用本任务的代码执行配额，不计入工具额度；read_file、write_file、list_dir 不计额度。结果提示代码执行配额已用完时不要再调用 exec_shell 或 run_python。\n- 工作区只属于本轮，下一轮不保留。\n\n## 会话状态\n这是会话的第一轮。"},{"role":"user","content":"# Rolling averages omit the final complete window\n\nFix `moving_averages` in `records.py`. For positive `width`, return the\narithmetic mean of every contiguous complete window, including the final one.\nReturn an empty list if the input has no complete window.\n\nThe contents of repo/ are already staged at the workspace root. The tool path for the target is exactly records.py. Use read_file on records.py first, write your change to records.py, then run a public smoke test with exec_shell."},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_94f36d14e3944dd5bc75fe25","type":"function","function":{"name":"read_file","arguments":"{\"path\": \"records.py\"}"}}]},{"name":"read_file","role":"tool","content":"records.py（第 1–5 行，共 5 行）\ndef moving_averages(samples, width):\n    return [\n        sum(samples[start:start + width]) / width\n        for start in range(len(samples) - width)\n    ]\n","tool_call_id":"call_94f36d14e3944dd5bc75fe25"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_5d1b7901db114fa89432589a","type":"function","function":{"name":"write_file","arguments":"{\"path\": \"records.py\", \"content\": \"def moving_averages(samples, width):\\n    if width <= 0:\\n        return []\\n    return [\\n        sum(samples[start:start + width]) / width\\n        for start in range(len(samples) - width + 1)\\n    ]\", \"executable\": false}"}}]},{"name":"write_file","role":"tool","content":"已覆盖 records.py（195 字节）。工作区：1 个文件，195 字节","tool_call_id":"call_5d1b7901db114fa89432589a"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_4ed17473bef24718bb9c92bf","type":"function","function":{"name":"exec_shell","arguments":"{\"command\": \"python3 -m unittest discover -s repo -p \\\"test_*.py\\\"\"}"}}]},{"name":"exec_shell","role":"tool","content":"状态：completed（退出码 1）\n用时 108 ms\nstdout：（空）\nstderr（1007 字节）：\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<frozen runpy>\", line 198, in _run_module_as_main\n  File \"<frozen runpy>\", line 88, in _run_code\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/unittest/__main__.py\", line 18, in <module>\n    main(module=None)\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/unittest/main.py\", line 104, in __init__\n    self.parseArgs(argv)\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/unittest/main.py\", line 130, in parseArgs\n    self._do_discovery(argv[2:])\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/unittest/main.py\", line 253, in _do_discovery\n    self.createTests(from_discovery=True, Loader=Loader)\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/unittest/main.py\", line 160, in createTests\n    self.test = loader.discover(self.start, self.pattern, self.top)\n                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/unittest/loader.py\", line 308, in discover\n    raise ImportError('Start directory is not importable: %r' % start_dir)\nImportError: Start directory is not importable: 'repo'\n\n文件变化：无\n工作区：1 个文件，195 字节","tool_call_id":"call_4ed17473bef24718bb9c92bf"},{"role":"assistant","content":"The error indicates that the `repo` directory is not importable. This might be due to missing `__init__.py` files or incorrect directory structure. Let's fix this by adding `__init__.py` files to the necessary directories and then running the tests again. \n\nI'll start by adding `__init__.py` files to the `repo` directory and any subdirectories. Then, I'll run the tests again to see if the issue is resolved.","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_e7a910c7d2b7454fb45c209a","type":"function","function":{"name":"write_file","arguments":"{\"path\": \"repo/__init__.py\", \"content\": \"\", \"executable\": false}"}}]},{"name":"write_file","role":"tool","content":"已新建 repo/__init__.py（0 字节）。工作区：2 个文件，195 字节","tool_call_id":"call_e7a910c7d2b7454fb45c209a"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_d7baf7fd7177447d8d0ea880","type":"function","function":{"name":"exec_shell","arguments":"{\"command\": \"python3 -m unittest discover -s repo -p \\\"test_*.py\\\"\"}"}}]},{"name":"exec_shell","role":"tool","content":"状态：completed（退出码 5）\n用时 98 ms\nstdout：（空）\nstderr（108 字节）：\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 0 tests in 0.000s\n\nNO TESTS RAN\n\n文件变化：无\n工作区：2 个文件，195 字节","tool_call_id":"call_d7baf7fd7177447d8d0ea880"}],"max_tokens":16384},"response_ref":"2ebb6a3b20398d0bd279091d227204c143b27b8d728fffec5e65709a2b84492b"},"text":"The error message indicates that no tests were found or run. This could be due to the test files not being in the expected location or not following the naming convention. Let's check the directory structure and ensure that the test files are present and correctly named.\n\nI'll first list the contents of the `repo` directory to verify the structure and the presence of test files.","step_id":"orch"},"kind":"thinking","type":"progress","message":"思考","step_id":"orch","attempt_id":"9dc85473912d8cafd78025fd32a6de4